# Runtime state from the DSH_HOME volume mount must never enter the build
# context: the container (root) writes home/attachments and home/sessions into
# the mounted host dir, and a root-owned directory under the context root
# kills `docker compose build harness` with "error from sender: permission
# denied". The image ships the PRESET only — runtime state arrives by mount.
home/attachments
home/sessions
home/storages
